// (fix31) g_coverNewRecs / g_coverNewCd: own and can-draw records LEARNED in this visit (the draws recorded, the harvest walk's can-draw records); what the
// start-up loads read (the card's stage file, its journal, the player file, the package's list: StageLoad) is not learning and is not counted. Visit totals:
// cleared after a "left" / "exit" line, kept across "periodic" ones, so the last line of a visit holds the visit's whole count.
unsigned g_coverNewRecs = 0, g_coverNewCd = 0;
