// first) that were not linked when its queue was made, less those linked since (render thread); their count for the game thread's hold;
// the end of the last stage slice that took an item, and whether a slice runs now (a single compile can take 0.3-1.4 s: not a stall).
std::unordered_set<uint32_t> g_stageOwnOpen;
